[CF Submitter] CLOUDFLARE BLOCK DETECTED (HTTP 403)
To solve this, you MUST extract your browser session cookie
and add it to your backend/.env file as CODEFORCES_COOKIE.

Steps to get your Codeforces cookie:
1. Open your browser and log in to https://codeforces.com
2. Open DevTools (F12) -> Network tab -> Refresh the page
3. Click on any request to codeforces.com
4. Under 'Request Headers', copy the value of the 'Cookie' header
5. Paste it in backend/.env:
   CODEFORCES_COOKIE=your_copied_cookie_string
============================================================

